{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face the most terrible danger that has ever befallen the elven lands in the new part of Elven Rivers 6 from 8Floor!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lands of the elves are on fire: the orcish horde led by a cunning shaman has invaded the forest expanses. Horror and destruction are all around, and hope is disappearing with every second... It seems that the unprecedented responsibility of returning the homeland falls on Selin's shoulders. The enemy is strong and cruel. But even in the darkest times, you can find friends who will come to your aid and stand shoulder to shoulder against evil and darkness. Take courage! The path will be long and exhausting, the trials - dangerous. And the price of defeat is enormous. But victory will also be expensive. Perhaps more expensive than anything. Are you ready to pay such a price?\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be hunted, but far from enemies, among new lands, the hunted can once again become a hunter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the eccentric dwarf inventor who will give hope to all the elven lands! * Choose one of the game modes: a calm narrative or an irreconcilable battle with time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Earn achievements and find collectibles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2495610?t=1754384293","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2495610?t=1754384293","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495610/e9218ff1c163ceda75bd19f6ded315eab999a3a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754384293","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495610/e9218ff1c163ceda75bd19f6ded315eab999a3a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754384293","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}]